# Protected integration tests

`tests/integration/core-flow.test.ts` is a **protected** CI test suite for the main product flow (app → question → register → sync → answer).

## Do not change unless the user explicitly asks

Never modify, delete, skip, or weaken these tests as part of unrelated work. See `tests/PROTECTED_TESTS.md` for the full list and rationale.

When the user **does** ask to change product behavior covered by this flow, update the tests to match the new behavior — do not remove coverage without replacement.
